{"format_version":"vbulletin-3+-thread","url":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/main-forum/the-new-world-of-darkness/demon-the-descent/849052-cover-creation-delay-and-time","id":849052,"title":"Cover Creation Delay and Time","path":["Home","Onyx Path","White Wolf Worlds","Chronicles of Darkness","Demon: The Descent"],"posts":[{"date":"2016-03-17T17:55:25-07:00","id":849052,"title":"Cover Creation Delay and Time","content":"Was looking through the book, and didn't see anything that specifically answers what I'm looking for. Does anyone know: 1) if it's possible to delay creation of a Cover (say I have 5 greater pacts out, and cash them all in at once to get 15 Cover Experience, and then craft a 5 dot Cover) and 2) how long does it take to patch everything together?<br /> <br /> Asking because, while I'm hesitant to raise Primum (want my demon to be somewhat remorseful about 'stealing' lives and losing his own, so seeing if it's possible to run with a single Cover), I'll do it if it's not feasible to be forced to Go Loud (or die) and then quickly craft a patch job to hide inside of.","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/11491-thehallow1","name":"thehallow1","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar11491_2.jpeg","title":"Member","rank":0,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Mar 2016"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"17"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2016-03-17T22:28:52-07:00","id":849150,"title":"","content":"The Cover Experiences a Pactbound gives a demon exist in abstract form as long as the pact exists and can be patched in basically whenever.<br /> <br /> It takes comparatively little time to assemble a Cover from various pieces \u2014 it happens in Thnetosis, one of the stories in the Interface supplement.","signature":"<hr class=\"b-divider\"/><br/><span style=\"font-family:trebuchet ms\"><span style=\"color:#4B0082\"><b>Resident Lore-Hound</b></span><br /> Currently Consuming: <i>Demon: the Descent 1e</i></span>","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/111-satchel","name":"Satchel","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar111_2.jpeg","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Nov 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"9828"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2016-03-18T10:18:14-07:00","id":849333,"title":"","content":"Though if even that is slow for you, I once saw a player go to a job fair under the guise of a employer for a company ( well partially, they did own a semi moderately sized business so there were semi innocent intentions involved), and built a very high grade Patchwork Cover in less than an hour. It was glorious, they made a rank 6-7 Cover and a few weeks later got several really well qualified people for their store chain. Good times.","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/1686-korogra","name":"Korogra","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar1686_2.jpeg","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Dec 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"1310"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2016-03-18T10:39:48-07:00","id":849342,"title":"","content":"<div class=\"bbcode_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote\"> <div class=\"quote_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote_container b-icon b-icon__ldquo-l--gray\"></div> <div class=\"bbcode_postedby\"> Originally posted by <strong>Satchel</strong> <a href=\"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/main-forum/the-new-world-of-darkness/demon-the-descent/849052-cover-creation-delay-and-time?p=849150#post849150\" rel=\"nofollow\" title=\"View Post\" class=\"b-icon b-icon__double-arrow-right--blue animate-scroll\">View Post</a> </div> <div class=\"message\">The Cover Experiences a Pactbound gives a demon exist in abstract form as long as the pact exists and can be patched in basically whenever.<br /> <br /> It takes comparatively little time to assemble a Cover from various pieces \u2014 it happens in Thnetosis, one of the stories in the Interface supplement.</div> </div> </div> </div><br /> Thanks!<br /> <br /> Just finished reading it - so as long as I have everything ready to go (basically, 15 experience points if I want a 5 dot Cover) I can do it on the fly.<br /> <br /> Very good - that makes me feel a lot better going into this game.<br /> <br /> <div class=\"bbcode_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote\"> <div class=\"quote_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote_container b-icon b-icon__ldquo-l--gray\"></div> <div class=\"bbcode_postedby\"> Originally posted by <strong>Korogra</strong> <a href=\"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/main-forum/the-new-world-of-darkness/demon-the-descent/849052-cover-creation-delay-and-time?p=849333#post849333\" rel=\"nofollow\" title=\"View Post\" class=\"b-icon b-icon__double-arrow-right--blue animate-scroll\">View Post</a> </div> <div class=\"message\">Though if even that is slow for you, I once saw a player go to a job fair under the guise of a employer for a company ( well partially, they did own a semi moderately sized business so there were semi innocent intentions involved), and built a very high grade Patchwork Cover in less than an hour. It was glorious, they made a rank 6-7 Cover and a few weeks later got several really well qualified people for their store chain. Good times.</div> </div> </div> </div>Heh, we're in a college town to start out. I think making Pacts is going to be ridiculously simple. Just have to offer a bunch of students money to live off of each month and I should be golden.","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/11491-thehallow1","name":"thehallow1","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar11491_2.jpeg","title":"Member","rank":0,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Mar 2016"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"17"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2016-03-18T11:08:42-07:00","id":849354,"title":"","content":"Just remember to protect your Pact documents. If they get destroyed, you take a hefty hit. So keeping them on you is risky, but if you store them off-site, you need to get them to make your Patchwork (I think).","signature":"<hr class=\"b-divider\"/><br/>Malkydel: &quot;And the Machine dictated; let there be adequate illumination.&quot;<br /> Yossarian: &quot;And lo, it was optimal.&quot;","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/7212-vent0","name":"Vent0","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar7212_2.jpeg","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Aug 2015"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"5184"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2016-03-18T11:44:23-07:00","id":849373,"title":"","content":"<div class=\"bbcode_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote\"> <div class=\"quote_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote_container b-icon b-icon__ldquo-l--gray\"></div> <div class=\"bbcode_postedby\"> Originally posted by <strong>Vent0</strong> <a href=\"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/main-forum/the-new-world-of-darkness/demon-the-descent/849052-cover-creation-delay-and-time?p=849354#post849354\" rel=\"nofollow\" title=\"View Post\" class=\"b-icon b-icon__double-arrow-right--blue animate-scroll\">View Post</a> </div> <div class=\"message\">Just remember to protect your Pact documents. If they get destroyed, you take a hefty hit. So keeping them on you is risky, but if you store them off-site, you need to get them to make your Patchwork (I think).</div> </div> </div> </div>Which is why Shielded Compartment is such a useful demon form ability, keeps your papers all nice and safe if on the move.. well unless you die. But still, better than nothing right?","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/1686-korogra","name":"Korogra","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar1686_2.jpeg","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Dec 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"1310"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2016-03-18T11:49:14-07:00","id":849376,"title":"","content":"<div class=\"bbcode_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote\"> <div class=\"quote_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote_container b-icon b-icon__ldquo-l--gray\"></div> <div class=\"bbcode_postedby\"> Originally posted by <strong>Korogra</strong> <a href=\"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/main-forum/the-new-world-of-darkness/demon-the-descent/849052-cover-creation-delay-and-time?p=849373#post849373\" rel=\"nofollow\" title=\"View Post\" class=\"b-icon b-icon__double-arrow-right--blue animate-scroll\">View Post</a> </div> <div class=\"message\"><br /> Which is why Shielded Compartment is such a useful demon form ability, keeps your papers all nice and safe if on the move.. well unless you die. But still, better than nothing right?</div> </div> </div> </div>Indeed. Though nothing beats its use as matryoshka-Demon delivery system.","signature":"<hr class=\"b-divider\"/><br/>Malkydel: &quot;And the Machine dictated; let there be adequate illumination.&quot;<br /> Yossarian: &quot;And lo, it was optimal.&quot;","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/7212-vent0","name":"Vent0","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar7212_2.jpeg","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Aug 2015"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"5184"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2016-03-18T12:48:59-07:00","id":849403,"title":"","content":"I'd like to ask something about Patchwork Covers too. How do you choose the appearance of the Cover? Most Pacts transform relationships of some sort into Cover Experiences. Does the Demon select a combination of features from the people they made Pacts with? Like, a face from A, the voice of B and the rest from C?","signature":"<hr class=\"b-divider\"/><br/>Bye.","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/4443-gibberingeloquence","name":"GibberingEloquence","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar4443_5.png","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Dec 2014"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"2470"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2016-03-18T13:01:14-07:00","id":849409,"title":"","content":"<div class=\"bbcode_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote\"> <div class=\"quote_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote_container b-icon b-icon__ldquo-l--gray\"></div> <div class=\"bbcode_postedby\"> Originally posted by <strong>GottaGoFeast</strong> <a href=\"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/main-forum/the-new-world-of-darkness/demon-the-descent/849052-cover-creation-delay-and-time?p=849403#post849403\" rel=\"nofollow\" title=\"View Post\" class=\"b-icon b-icon__double-arrow-right--blue animate-scroll\">View Post</a> </div> <div class=\"message\">I'd like to ask something about Patchwork Covers too. How do you choose the appearance of the Cover? Most Pacts transform relationships of some sort into Cover Experiences. Does the Demon select a combination of features from the people they made Pacts with? Like, a face from A, the voice of B and the rest from C?</div> </div> </div> </div>This was asked before. I think the response (consensus or not) was that you look like a blend of all your Pactees. I'm guessing you have some slight control over edge cases at least, such as when Pact Elements come evenly from both sexes (you might say that the Cover would look androgynous, but it's probably a good idea to settle on one set of parts).","signature":"<hr class=\"b-divider\"/><br/>Malkydel: &quot;And the Machine dictated; let there be adequate illumination.&quot;<br /> Yossarian: &quot;And lo, it was optimal.&quot;","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/7212-vent0","name":"Vent0","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar7212_2.jpeg","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Aug 2015"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"5184"}]},"thankedby":[]}]}